e to film-making savoir-faire.</p><p>Stuck making corporate videos to support his young family, Adelaide-based Frith is in danger of letting his artistic ambitions atrophy. So he opts for career shock therapy by cold-calling The Asylum (of <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2018/aug/15/sharknado-silliest-movie-franchise-film">Sharknado notoriety)</a> in Burbank, California and proposing he oversee one of their straight-to-the-digital-cesspit features.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/mockbuster-review-how-to-survive-the-nightmare-of-directing-a-terrible-low-budget-horror-film">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FToSn_e-6xqy5ZencAbz6OL8gmXrmKCipioepup6G_8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;4oYPWUdMq1v0NE8f3w-AhE15r_pxZFJb47h30R4Xf6kƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YuomBYFHiIMxFIEBiYhwqmVv21Mw8wFYxhqFpcoaXzsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pkSPobsw8GZyuloO31xAqunsI30Y1A_6vUB9oDBw9tIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7Fo5vbVjZiHRQ6DKm-9mackZWekF3fqfb0FzRYbZv1oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iqMExFNqsnoLmd0FmOmg6XacxdpOF7bB7vKpD6IzwGAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;72VeOSehuxswhBLuGQQzoR6QLvU9GwWLqDpUA4IV09Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5KT8Uk7OHpCMI1L3UgwQQSrmUAMy6bVU-6RjhiG0noEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdun